Scoped Computerized Speech Lab NSP demuxer

The probe, the chunk walk (HEDR/HDR8 rate, NOTE comment, audio chunk ids and
the unskipped unknown chunks) and the s16le stream parameters in src/nsp.ts
follow libavformat/nspdec.c (nsp_probe, nsp_read_header) and the
avio_get_str semantics of libavformat/aviobuf.c; packet reads use the shared
raw PCM reader, following libavformat/pcm.c (ff_pcm_read_packet,
ff_pcm_read_seek).
